	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Pl.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">De d. <persName ref="p8111">Petro Martyre</persName> etsi dolere nihil prodest, tamen <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nescio quo pacto dolor ipse iucundus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Hei mihi!</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">dignus quidem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ille fuit, illa ingenii magnitudine, illa literarum multitudine, illa pietate, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>illis moribus, illa vita, qui nunquam e vita tolleretur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>hoc ego iam antea fore divinabam, ubi primum audissem, hominem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>id aetatis animum adiecisse ad nuptias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Deus opt. max. <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>benigne respiciat ecclesiam suam, et illi demortuo suscitet alios.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Pauci estis, mi pater, pauci estis, quibus nunc rerum summa <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nititur; nam te semper numeravi inter primos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">O utinam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>semper existant aliqui, quibus possitis hanc lampadem committere!</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Sed missa ista facio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName> vester <placeName ref="l512">Tubingensis</placeName>, monstro<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>rum fabricator, non domitor, otiose iam triumphat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">In toto illo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>suo regno Ubiquetario tam amplis spatiis et regionibus miror <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>si possit consistere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Si quid moliri velit in hominem mortuum, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et eius scripta possint ad nos perferri, nisi quis vestrum mihi velit <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>antevertere, ego mearum partium esse puto, quantum negotia mea <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>patientur, ut illi respondeam; si nihil aliud, saltem ut intelligi pos<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sit, <placeName ref="l830">Angliam</placeName> et <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiam</placeName> contra istos Ubiquetarios convenire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Interitus <persName>Guisani Pharaonis</persName>, quem hodierno die pro explorato et <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>certo accipimus, crede mihi, intimum mihi animum et pectus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>perculit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ita erat repentinus, ita oportunus, ita faustus, ita <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>omnem spem atque expectationem nostram superabat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nunc animi putemus esse fratribus nostris; quos illa bestia <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>iam cinxerat obsidione, quosque spe et cogitatione prope iam cruentis <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>faucibus devorarat?</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sit nomen domini benedictum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName>Chattilio</persName> nunc opugnat arcem Canensem, et crescit in dies; et spes bona <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>est adversarios venturos ad conditiones nostras, et omnia ita futura ut <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>volumus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Regina nostra colligit militem e <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName>, et dat stipendium, et <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nihil parcit sumptibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Nos hoc tempore conventus agimus totius regni, et de <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>religione secundis animis tractamus, deque republica, et de nervis bellorum, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>hoc est, de pecunia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">E <placeName ref="l2524">Scotia</placeName> nunciantur recte omnia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Regina pene sola et pertinaciam animi Guisianam et missam suam <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>retinet, invitis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Nostra regina superiori autumno laboravit <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>e variolis, satis cum periculo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Impatiens aestus et taedii se ipsam pene per<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>diderat.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Sed agimus deo gratias, qui et illam periculo liberavit et nos m<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>etu.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Quid paterculi illi vestri <persName ref="p19939">Tridentini</persName> et papa hydropicus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>parturiant, nihil audimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Fortasse spiritus sanctus adesse non vult, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>aut fari non potest.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Quicquid est, tanto in conventu, tanta <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>expectatione, nihil agi mirum est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Ego post superioris aestatis <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>atque huius hyemis intemperiem, et aliquot dierum spasmos et ca<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>tarrhos, iam tandem incipio convalescere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Scripta d. <persName ref="p8111">P. Martyris</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ne intereant, non dubito tibi curae fore: magno illi vivo constiterunt, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>et digna sunt, ut scis, quae magni fiant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, vir ornatissime, et <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>frater ac domine in Christo colendissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta optimam illam <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>mulierem, uxorem tuam, filios, nurus, d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvalterum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8442">Simlerum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>d. <persName ref="p1884">Lavaterum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p7228">Zvinglium</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8461">Wickium</persName>, d. <persName ref="p3988">Volphium</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>d. <persName ref="p1453">Hallerum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p1283">Ghesnerum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p1214">Frisium</persName> meo nomine.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Dominus te nobis diu servet salvum et incolumem!</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">5. martii 1563.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Tuus in Christo fra<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>ter et tuo nomini d<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>editissimus <persName ref="p8391">Io[<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>annes] Iuellus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Ohne Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
